D. Plan mode for the bug fix, direct execution for the migration

**4.6 (Domain 3)** — Developers invoke `/generate-fixture` bare, without entity type/record count, then get confused. Which frontmatter option fixes this?
A. `context: fork`
B. `allowed-tools`
C. Longer skill description
D. `argument-hint` — prompts for required parameters when invoked without arguments

**4.7 (Domain 3)** — Where should (1) universal coding standards and (2) an occasional multi-step release-notes workflow live?
A. Both as skills
