**4.8 (Domain 1)** — Open-ended task: "add comprehensive tests to this legacy codebase," risk concentration unknown. Which decomposition fits?
A. Map codebase structure, identify high-impact areas, create a prioritized plan that adapts as dependencies/surprises are discovered
